was that it was a person who owned the store and was there all the time. And so in the early days, you would know who your local franchise owner was and that person would be at the Kwanis Club. There's a person who's sponsoring Little League that this was this like very local thing. And then solely but surely in order for people to really make money in this system, they start owning multiple franchises and their portfolio is filled with fast food outlets.
是，它是一个拥有这家店并一直呆在那里的个人。所以在早期，你会知道谁是你的本地特许经营商，那个人会出现在基瓦尼斯俱乐部。会有这样一个人赞助少年棒球队，这是一件非常本地化的事情。然后为了让人们真正能在这个系统中赚钱，他们开始拥有多个特许经营权，他们的投资组合里塞满了快餐店。

